# Qwen3.8-27B for AI Classroom Live's local server (D-14).
#
#   ollama create qwen3.8-aula -f docs/ollama/Modelfile.aula
#
# Shares the weights of qwen3.8:27b, so it takes no extra disk. It exists so the
# classroom's settings do not change the model other applications use with a
# large context (Hermes Desktop needs 65k).
#
# Measured on the RTX 5070 Ti (13/09/2026): 9.3 GB of VRAM with this context,
# against 13.7 GB with 65,536 tokens, leaving room for Whisper and Kokoro.
# Both variants cannot sit on a 16 GB card at once: Ollama unloads one to load
# the other.

FROM qwen3.8:27b

# A class needs a few questions and answers of history, not a book.
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
# A ceiling for an answer read aloud: about a minute and a half of speech.
PARAMETER num_predict 350
